WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:07.580
In the closing years of the Sengoku Era,

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:12.160
Japan was consumed by perpetual conflict.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.160
 

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:23.159
In this fight, between the large warrior and the swordsman, note the crest on the helmet of the smaller warrior.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.340
It's almost identical to the one that the Ashina clan's Commander wears.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.980
So this swordsman is either that same main antagonist

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:36.720
of "Sekiro: Shadows Die Twice" who goes on to cut off our arm or

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:43.980
More likely, it's the grandfather of the commander who is known as the legendary Ashina Isshin.

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:51.059
He was a Sword Saint who wrested this country from its former owners and who went on this big campaign to

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:53.909
embed the Ashina clan within this country.

00:00:53.909 --> 00:00:59.660
If so, this battle that we're seeing here could be the battle that started at all.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:06.680
In the aftermath of the fight, our young Sekiro kneels on the battlefield and he's unaware or uncaring

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:09.179
that he's being approached by another warrior.

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:18.730
What's the matter stray nothing left to lose?

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:24.600
Considering he already has two katanas on his back and he's being called a stray?

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:30.340
He may either be looting the battlefield or perhaps he's wishing that he was stronger

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:34.900
because it's possible that he has indeed lost everything

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:37.510
Well, would you look at that?

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:41.500
Will you join me, starving wolf?

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:47.280
The grizzled warrior who is covered in this sash of feathers is

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:54.800
almost certainly The Owl - a man who took Sekiro under his wing and raised him to become The Wolf.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:02:01.180
We know this because in another trailer, one of The Owl's old acquaintances named Lady Butterfly

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:07.640
Calls us his brat and as Sekiro grabs the Owl's sword. He displays his willingness

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.540
to start anew.

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:13.920
He is later, we realized how the grown-up wolf got that scar

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:18.100
That day, I pulled you from the battlefield.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:22.179
I had no idea what you'd become.

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:25.439
With this trailer,

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:27.720
you can already see the tragedy unfolding.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:34.739
We get this chilling insight into why a shinobi feels so driven to recover the prince after we lose him.

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:42.220
It's because The Owl rescued Sekiro from the battlefield and raised him as a sort of foster father and

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:44.780
Sekiro - The Wolf - us

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:50.800
We were not able to be that same man to the foster child we lost.

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:56.820
In the coming 24 hours, I'm going to be releasing another video called the "Prosthetic Art Challenge"

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:02.660
and if you're an artist, if you know an artist or hell if you feel like commissioning an artist for this.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:10.360
Please get involved or spread the word, the goal put simply is to design a prosthetic arm weapon that we haven't seen before.

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:15.660
For prizes, I'm putting up $1500 of my own money for the top ten entrants.

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:19.620
We've got Humble Bundle keys for the runners-up and there's a potential

00:03:20.109 --> 00:03:23.909
mystery prize if you send in your submission within two weeks.

00:03:24.189 --> 00:03:28.228
The goal is to give pretty much every serious entrant a prize and

00:03:28.629 --> 00:03:32.279
because I'm going to be showing off the winners and their portfolio in another video.

00:03:32.349 --> 00:03:36.328
Hey, this could be a cool opportunity if you're an artist looking to make a name for yourself

00:03:36.340 --> 00:03:41.310
And I know everyone in the comments will appreciate the hell out of any art you make for us.

00:03:41.319 --> 00:03:43.319
So check out the video in the description!

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:45.520
For more details on how to enter,

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:49.979
I'll be giving you guys an art template that you can draw on and a lot more details.

00:03:49.979 --> 00:03:52.679
So check it out and I hope to see you there!!

